Explanation:

Because pH is logarithmic ($"pH" = -log_10 [H^+]$), a decrease of $0.15$ pH units corresponds to a ratio of $10^(0.15) approx 1.41$, representing a $approx 41%$ increase in hydrogen ion concentration.
